<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The fourteen domains (Gods/GodDefs.cs, GodDomainDef; docs/design/gods.md, "Domains"), kept as the stage 2 parts'
    fallback table only: each of the nine gods is a def of its own (Defs/GodDefs/Rimfolk_Gods.xml), and a domain is the key
    a part falls back on where it has nothing written for a god. For each: what its gods are gods of, two colours, and its
    sacred things: animal kinds and plants by defName (the game's and the player's active mods', looked up softly), a place
    and a deed.
  -->

